### 1. Accessible UI component library

A small, typed Vue component library: modal, combobox, tabs, toast, data table.

- **Shows:** accessibility (WAI-ARIA, keyboard, focus management), component architecture, design systems
- **Stack:** TypeScript,Vue , Storybook, Testing Library, Playwright, axe-core, GitHub Actions, published to npm
- **Stand-out detail:** an accessibility test for every component that runs in CI
- **Interview story:** "How I made a combobox screen-reader friendly"
